That was Pucci he just hit.

267
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:43,977
What's your problem, you fool?

268
00:15:44,060 --> 00:15:45,178
That was your ally.

269
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,277
Just run!

270
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,760
Move, you guys!

271
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:54,160
Move me, huh? Just go! Get out of there!

272
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:56,960
We can figure out a plan once we're safe!

273
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:58,590
Run!

274
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,111
All right, you heard him.

275
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,557
But Zoro...

276
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:11,657
The captain just said we can
figure it out after we're safe!

277
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:12,570
Come on!

278
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:15,342
Come on, buddy.

279
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:17,177
That last beam just grazed me.

280
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:18,436
I can help you walk.

281
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:20,940
Go, you two.

282
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:22,080
I'll cover you.

283
00:16:22,300 --> 00:16:23,241
Stop it, Brooke!

284
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:24,480
That's crazy!

285
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:31,380
I'll protect you.

286
00:16:31,940 --> 00:16:34,300
Even if it costs me my life!

287
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,758
Oh, but I'm already dead, I suppose.

288
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:39,320
Brooke, no!

289
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,750
Damn it!

290
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:50,219
How the hell can I let this happen?

291
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:53,969
The bastards are racing all my
friends right in front of me!

292
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,200
Get back!

293
00:16:55,940 --> 00:16:56,770
Sanji!

294
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,460
Start running, Usopp!

295
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:01,100
Not a chance!

296
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:02,937
I'm not going without you, Sanji!

297
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:04,120
Son of a bitch!

298
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,897
Sanji! Just run! Come on!

299
00:17:07,980 --> 00:17:10,200
Nobody does that to my Gourmet!

300
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:20,400
Sachi!

301
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,120
No!

302
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:30,240
Get back!

303
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:32,080
Stay away!

304
00:17:35,900 --> 00:17:39,540
Stop where you are! Get back! Blamestar!

305
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:43,360
One more! Blamestar!

306
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,860
Go away, please!

307
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:47,780
Just leave me alone!

308
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,560
Moose up, run!

309
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,480
Stop it!

310
00:18:05,220 --> 00:18:06,580
Usopp

311
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:09,820
Soji

312
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,457
Damn you!

313
00:18:13,540 --> 00:18:16,737
You can't win.

314
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:18,000
Don't fight.

315
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:28,337
He got Sanji!

316
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:29,577
What now?

317
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:31,097
What do we do?

318
00:18:31,180 --> 00:18:33,177
It can't be!

319
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:35,060
They're all gone.

320
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:44,597
It's starting to sound like they
could really use my help over there.

321
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:47,080
There's only so much an old man can do.

322
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:51,017
I guess I'm not quite the
fighter I used to be So fending

323
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:54,217
off a Navy Admiral isn't
enough to make you satisfied,

324
00:18:54,300 --> 00:18:55,130
huh?

325
00:18:55,213 --> 00:18:57,017
Why don't you keep those
thoughts to yourself?

326
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:59,629
You're already making
me look bad, you know

327
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,920
Dark King Rayleigh correct

328
00:19:14,740 --> 00:19:15,570
Kuma?

329
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,420
Wait, Luffy.

330
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:28,740
You can't be serious.

331
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:30,980
You're asking me to trust you?

332
00:19:31,320 --> 00:19:33,180
That's entirely your decision.

333
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:36,267
But I'm putting my own
neck on the line, too.

334
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:37,990
All right.

335
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:41,597
I feel like I deserve an
explanation here. Kuma?

336
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:45,200
This matter is of no
consequence to the government,

337
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:49,020
so I have no obligation to
cooperate with the Navy.

338
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:51,540
And you deserve nothing of the sort.

339
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:53,020
You bastard!

340
00:19:55,300 --> 00:19:57,220
Now, second gear!

341
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:04,900
Get the hell out of our way!

342
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,540
I'm right!

343
00:20:09,800 --> 00:20:11,060
What the...

344
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:16,240
Luffy, no!

345
00:20:17,660 --> 00:20:20,520
Come on, Jack, can't go!

346
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:28,860
Luffy!

347
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:44,040
Someone help me!

348
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:46,080
Nami!

349
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:16,930
Luffy!

350
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:26,860
Chopper, no!

351
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:37,340
Chopper, no!

352
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:38,520
Don't do it!

353
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,240
Damn it.

354
00:22:01,220 --> 00:22:02,820
No more.

355
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:04,820
Please stop.

356
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:06,760
Please stop.

357
00:22:08,460 --> 00:22:09,897
Stop it!

358
00:22:09,980 --> 00:22:11,392
I can't leave her alone!

359
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:14,820
Luffy!

360
00:22:15,380 --> 00:22:16,740
Robin!

361
00:22:18,620 --> 00:22:19,450
Luffy!

362
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:44,120
The End

363
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:54,300
I don't know.

364
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:15,767
I couldn't save any of them.

365
00:23:16,260 --> 00:23:17,760
What's wrong with me?

366
00:23:25,780 --> 00:23:29,080
So, you're just gonna blast
him off like the rest?

367
00:23:33,100 --> 00:23:36,680
You can't pull this mess without
an explanation, you know.

368
00:23:38,120 --> 00:23:40,880
And boy, it had better be a good one.

369
00:23:50,520 --> 00:23:53,660
You and I will never meet again.

370
00:24:04,120 --> 00:24:05,540
Farewell, Striad.

371
00:24:20,260 --> 00:24:26,060
Grove 12, the Sabaody Archipelago,
deep in the Grand Line.

372
00:24:26,980 --> 00:24:31,000
On this day, the Straw Hat
Pirates, led by Captain Monkey D.

373
00:24:31,120 --> 00:24:34,600
Luffy, came face to
face with true despair.

374
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:40,840
And one by one, they were eliminated.
